  "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free",
  "createdAt": "2026-09-26T09:58:44.058259Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-03T08:08:06.475626Z",
  "totalBlocks": 25,
  "translatedBlocks": 24,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "90d179928ec3aa77",
      "translationZh": "我已经花了几个月时间在构建这个，主要是为了自己使用，它刚刚发布了正式版，所以我想发布一下。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0cc93a6fe06dd18a",
      "translationZh": "这是一个原生的 GGUF 推理运行时，提供 OpenAI/Anthropic 兼容的 API 和聊天 UI。核心思想是使用一张消费级 NVIDIA 显卡 + 大量内存：无法完全放入 VRAM 的 MoE 模型会将其专家部分运行在 CPU 上，或者将热点集合缓存在显卡上进行分割。它会在启动时自行判断什么能够放下，而不是让你猜测卸载层数。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "83bc6938f97e9de2",
      "translationZh": "它可以运行 Qwen 3.x 密集版和 MoE（包括 Qwen3.8-Flash-Next）、DeepSeek-V4-Flash、Ling 3.0、K2-Horizon、Gemma 4、Laguna、Muse Glimmer。Qwen 模型的图像输入通过 mmproj 实现。此外，它还能在同一张显卡上与聊天模型并行运行 Z-Image-Turbo 图像生成。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d343f40f261e797d",
      "translationZh": "来自我的笔记本电脑的数据（5070 Ti 12 GB，60 GB RAM）：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "502dfca72e0473f7",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3.8-Flash-Next IQ1_S：约 35 token/秒解码，约 475 token/秒预填充",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3d25baf4816c0473",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3.8-27B IQ2_XXS：约 40 token/秒",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8a407f2b82a1773f",
      "translationZh": "DeepSeek-V4-Flash：6-7 token/秒（这基本上是 DRAM 带宽的上限）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0c09b4c976ff74e2",
      "translationZh": "Z-Image 1024x1024 分辨率在约 15 秒内生成，旁边加载了一个 35B 模型",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "58c5fa183ac721da",
      "translationZh": "内核在运行时由 NVRTC 编译，因此 wheel 中不包含 CUDA 工具包，也不需要 nvcc。相同的内核源码也可以作为纯 C++ 编译用于仅 CPU 的后端。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b442072934eb02c7",
      "translationZh": "KV 缓存采用 f16 / q8_0 / TurboQuant 4-bit。在密集的 27B 模型，序列长度 32K 时，这就是 10.8 与 22.9 tok/s 之间的区别，因为它是保持权重在显卡上的关键。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7ac7cd3dbb0064f7",
      "translationZh": "工具调用由采样器语法强制执行，且温度/惩罚在调用内被限制，以便编辑工具能够精确复制文件内容。这使得 Claude Code / opencode 在小量化模型上变得不易出现波动。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "060c8b4050269140",
      "translationZh": "思考预算是一个硬上限，此外还提供 stop_thinking 端点，以将流切换到答案。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9d9bc11fafdb5d36",
      "translationZh": "完全披露：此内容很大程度上是借助 AI（主要是 Claude Code）编写的。我负责设计、测量以及争论什么实际上更快；AI 负责大量的输入。每个内核都会与参考实现进行奇偶校验测试，性能数字是真实测量得到的，但如果这对你来说是个无法接受的问题，那也没关系。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f3e7f53098016385",
      "translationZh": "提供 Linux x86-64 和 Windows 的 wheel。需要 NVIDIA 驱动程序 + CUDA 工具包（用于 NVRTC 和头文件），或者使用 --backend cpu。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "214a7e3cb963024c",
      "translationZh": "这是一个个人项目，个人难免有盲点。欢迎提交 PR 和 issue，尤其是：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b5759c0deeaa3764",
      "translationZh": "在其他硬件上运行。所有测试均在一台 Blackwell 笔记本和一台 Intel 机器上进行。Ampere/Ada、AMD CPU、8 GB 显卡均未测试。即使只是提供 flyweight doctor 输出以及一个 tok/s 数字的 issue 也有帮助。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "66eac0d4ace5ccc2",
      "translationZh": "Windows 用户。CI 通过，实际使用较少。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f3f208ceab81e1f4",
      "translationZh": "macOS / ARM。没有 wheels，尚未尝试。CPU 后端应能编译。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d9cb7d238dd42e83",
      "translationZh": "llama.cpp 能运行的模型而此项目不能。请打开一个 issue 并提供 GGUF 元数据。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d8b0554fc0a94ea7",
      "translationZh": "CPU 专家内核，尤其是 1-3 位 IQ 格式。这是一切 MoE 的瓶颈。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "86527fa5da46b372",
      "translationZh": "安装过程中遇到的任何问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c06b447cdc71379f",
      "translationZh": "有一个 plans/ 目录，里面记录了已尝试和已放弃的内容，因此在提出建议前请先查看。CONTRIBUTING.md 中还有其余信息。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "948877add4bb2ac1",
      "translationZh": "很乐意回答问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b91aeae9497d80e9",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/Main-Wolverine-1042 提交",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    }
